# Before/After Mixed Generators Example
# Initial definition uses multiple generators (Values + Int Range); extensions add more values with before/after.
# From Story125/Story126/Story201: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer - Before/After
#
# Note: Integer-valued anchors (e.g., `before 10`) require INTEGER in the identifier rule.
# Use Values-based anchors around Int Range values until that support is added.

concepts
	# Base concept with mixed generators: Values anchors + Int Range numeric values
	Status=[Values[Start], Int[10, 50, 10], Values[End]]

concepts
	# Insert a priority flag before the first anchor value
	Status=[Values[Priority]] before Start

	# Insert a final flag after the last anchor value
	Status=[Values[Final]] after End
